Third-party teletext font bitmap data

The embedded teletext glyph masks are derived from teletextimager 0.2.0,
commit 2b0125b778c45ffdfa2df0b196870c093361f317. The bitmap data is distributed
under the following MIT license; ErsatzRS code retains the zlib license above.

